  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0: Aligned with TypeScript SDK v6.0. Added singleton pattern for CaptivateChatApi instances (automatic deduplication per API key/mode). Added IDisposable with Dispose() to close connections and remove from registry. Added conversation.FileManager (ConversationFileManager) for context-aware file operations. Added conversation.SetTimeToLiveAsync(days) for session TTL management. Added CaptivateChatManager.Dispose(apiKey) and DisposeAll() for multi-tenant cleanup. Fixed debug mode bug where OnWebSocketMessage bypassed SetDebugMode(false) and always wrote to console. Added GetInstance/HasInstance static helpers.",
